en/henry-wu\" class=\"entity-link\">Dr. Henry Wu</a>\n            — Wu is InGen&#039;s chief geneticist.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/jurassic-park/masrani-global\" class=\"entity-link\">Masrani Global Corporation</a>\n            — Masrani inherits InGen&#039;s dinosaur technology.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/jurassic-park\" class=\"entity-link\">Jurassic Park</a>\n            — <a href=\"/jurassic-park\" class=\"entity-link\">Jurassic Park</a> is connected to InGen through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/jurassic-park/michael-crichton\" class=\"entity-link\">Michael Crichton</a>\n            — <a href=\"/jurassic-park/michael-crichton\" class=\"entity-link\">Michael Crichton</a> is connected to InGen through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/jurassic-park/jurassic-park-novel\" class=\"entity-link\">Jurassic Park (novel)</a>\n            — <a href=\"/jurassic-park/jurassic-park-novel\" class=\"entity-link\">Jurassic Park (novel)</a> is connected to InGen through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/jurassic-park/jurassic-world/owen-grady\" class=\"entity-link\">Owen Grady</a>\n            — <a href=\"/jurassic-park/jurassic-world/owen-grady\" class=\"entity-link\">Owen Grady</a> is connected to InGen through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/jurassic-park/isla-sorna\" class=\"entity-link\">Isla Sorna</a>\n            — <a href=\"/jurassic-park/isla-sorna\" class=\"entity-link\">Isla Sorna</a> is connected to InGen through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connect